 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AppFabric API (2023-05-19). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. App bundles and audit-log ingestions are configuration metadata: ingestions stay disabled because StartIngestion, StopIngestion and data collection are not implemented, and no SaaS application is contacted. App authorizations (OAuth and API-key credentials), ingestion destinations and user-access tasks return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. App bundles with ingestions cannot be deleted, and customer managed keys must be given as key ARNs; no encryption is performed.",
  "title": "AWS AppFabric (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2023-05-19"
 },
